            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "GetVesselSchedule",
            "handlerDescription": "Get the sailing schedule (voyages) joined to vessels and ports, including voyage_id, service_name, vessel_id, vessel_name, origin_port and origin_port_name, destination_port and destination_port_name, etd, eta, transit_days, and status (Scheduled, Departed, Arrived, Delayed, Cancelled). Use this for questions about sailings, departure/arrival dates, transit time, and which vessel serves a lane.",
