          "description": "Retrieve all charges",
          "settings": {
            "handlerType": "Tool",
            "resourceUri": "",
            "handlerName": "GetCharges",
            "handlerDescription": "Get all charges on bookings including charge_id, booking_ref, charge_type (Freight, Demurrage, Detention, BAF, THC), amount_usd, currency, free_days, days_used, status (Invoiced, Paid, Disputed, Waived), and charge_date. Use this to break down a booking's freight and accessorial charges and to check demurrage/detention free_days versus days_used before a dispute.",
